			"_k": 0,
			"desc": "Submersible well pump, 120 gpm at 275 ft, about 15 hp. Runs when TANK-1 falls below 16 ft and stops above 19 ft. The 14 ft of tank below 16 ft holds about 47,000 gal and the pump adds about 14,000 gal in two hours, over the 60,000 gal that 500 gpm needs for two hours.",
